<p>Both of these criticisms are totally fair. So far this has been among my more controversial SCPs in terms of votes and I'm guessing that most of the downvotes are for similar reasons to yours.</p>
<p>As for the first criticism, the trolley problem is <em>absolutely</em> a cliché, and I only included it because I thought it would make this easier to understand for more readers.</p>
<p>And for the second, I'm even thinking a lot of the same things; most of what I did in this respect was just because I thought it would be cool. The A and B versions of the document are a format screw idea that I had that I just really wanted to use, and I only chose an O5 over another ethicist because, again, I just liked the sound of it.</p>
<p>So, I mean, I have reasons for the choices I made, but I can see how not everyone would like them.</p>

